{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Kartvizit Cep 是一款把紙本名片掃描成數碼聯絡人的工具，適合經常出席會議、展覽或商務場合的人士。它可保存名片與相片、追蹤跟進事項，並讓你分享自己的數碼名片。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-164.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>名片掃描與跟進</h2>\n<p>你可以用相機掃描名片或從相簿選取相片，程式會自動讀取姓名、公司、職稱、電話、電郵、網站及地址，儲存前可檢查修正。它支援批次掃描、名片封存與搜尋，亦可設定跟進提醒；開啟名片即可致電、以 WhatsApp 傳訊、寄電郵或在地圖顯示地址。你還能製作個人數碼名片，透過 QR 碼、圖片或 VCF 檔案分享。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-442-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-443-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-444-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-445-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-446-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-447-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Kartvizit Cep</li><li>應用類別：Business</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/kartvizit-cep/id6811803001?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.218769+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T12:10:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:26.431383+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:25.713876+00:00","content_hash":"0e06c694547b7c4925312cb040f8e71d152dcba98831b2fdf3a7a5f132511318","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}